1
00:00:36,600 --> 00:00:37,400
Husband?

2
00:00:38,860 --> 00:00:39,260
Yes,

3
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:42,130
the kind who bowed to heaven and earth,

4
00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:44,900
the kind with a marriage certificate.

5
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:47,160
The seal you stamped and the fingerprint you pressed

6
00:00:47,160 --> 00:00:48,500
are still on my chest.

7
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:52,890
I don't remember anything.

8
00:00:56,730 --> 00:00:58,500
I gave my body to you.

9
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:00,600
How can you deny it?

10
00:01:03,430 --> 00:01:04,959
Why should I believe you?

11
00:01:07,400 --> 00:01:12,130
Because you didn't let go when you held my hand just now.

12
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:22,730
Which blind fool...

13
00:01:23,300 --> 00:01:23,730
Oh,

14
00:01:24,260 --> 00:01:26,260
you two little bugs are quite tough.

15
00:01:26,330 --> 00:01:27,700
I was going to let you go,

16
00:01:28,060 --> 00:01:29,860
but you touched my wife just now.

17
00:01:40,229 --> 00:01:42,030
You stepped on her hand just now.

18
00:01:43,259 --> 00:01:44,520
I stepped on your head,

19
00:01:44,530 --> 00:01:46,330
but it doesn't feel like enough.

20
00:01:46,600 --> 00:01:47,229
How about

21
00:01:47,430 --> 00:01:48,960
I step on it a few more times?

22
00:01:57,630 --> 00:01:58,530
And this one.

23
00:01:59,060 --> 00:02:00,600
You stepped on her hand just now, right?

24
00:02:00,600 --> 00:02:01,260
Which foot?

25
00:02:01,830 --> 00:02:02,560
I remember

26
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,430
it seems to be this one.

27
00:02:04,930 --> 00:02:05,400
Wife,

28
00:02:05,660 --> 00:02:06,460
am I handsome?

29
00:02:06,530 --> 00:02:07,630
How many points would you give me?

30
00:02:07,630 --> 00:02:08,360
Out of ten.

31
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:10,030
Who exactly are you?

32
00:02:10,830 --> 00:02:11,930
Your husband.

33
00:02:13,230 --> 00:02:15,160
Wife, your memory is not very good.

34
00:02:15,700 --> 00:02:17,500
You sometimes lose your memory.

35
00:02:17,730 --> 00:02:18,600
I'm used to it.

36
00:02:19,930 --> 00:02:21,190
Let's go home quickly.

37
00:02:21,829 --> 00:02:23,560
I'll slowly help you remember.

38
00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:33,000
Back then, I fell at your door covered in injuries,

39
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:33,930
and you saved me.

40
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:37,460
Then I said to you,

41
00:02:45,060 --> 00:02:46,460
'Please save me, okay?'

42
00:02:49,500 --> 00:02:50,430
And then?

43
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:53,730
Then you saw how pitiful I was

44
00:02:54,130 --> 00:02:54,860
and saved me.

45
00:02:55,760 --> 00:02:58,020
I made a fuss about wanting to be with you.

46
00:02:58,660 --> 00:03:01,060
I even planted a peach blossom forest for you

47
00:03:01,060 --> 00:03:03,700
and went to see it exactly seventy-eight times.

48
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:06,200
How did you count seventy-eight times?

49
00:03:06,500 --> 00:03:08,200
I squatted next to it and counted.

50
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,730
The seventy-ninth time, you found me

51
00:03:09,730 --> 00:03:11,190
and even threw fruit at me.

52
00:03:13,730 --> 00:03:14,790
I don't believe it.

53
00:03:16,400 --> 00:03:17,600
You don't believe it?

54
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:20,130
Then you have a mole on your body,

55
00:03:20,130 --> 00:03:21,790
on the left side of your waist.

56
00:03:22,630 --> 00:03:23,430
Shut up.

57
00:03:24,730 --> 00:03:25,200
Look,

58
00:03:25,560 --> 00:03:26,690
you know where it is,

59
00:03:26,829 --> 00:03:28,290
which means you remember.

60
00:03:29,329 --> 00:03:30,130
You...

61
00:03:38,030 --> 00:03:38,800
Baili.

62
00:03:40,100 --> 00:03:40,660
Baili,

63
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:42,460
don't scare me.

64
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:46,060
Lord,

65
00:03:46,060 --> 00:03:47,860
this is the God of War, Baili.

66
00:03:48,160 --> 00:03:48,460
Yes.

67
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:52,560
She was just beaten down by those bastards in heaven

68
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:53,690
and lost her memory.

69
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:59,060
Why not take the God of War, Baili, back to Cangyuan Hall and ask the Medicine Demon to treat her?

70
00:03:59,060 --> 00:03:59,630
No.

71
00:04:00,730 --> 00:04:02,700
The God of War, Baili, will get suspicious.

72
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:04,360
Go to Hundred Flowers Valley.

73
00:04:09,130 --> 00:04:11,130
Baili will definitely like it here.

74
00:04:34,330 --> 00:04:35,060
Bear with it.

75
00:04:36,100 --> 00:04:37,500
It'll be fine in a moment.

76
00:04:38,430 --> 00:04:39,100
Lord,

77
00:04:39,530 --> 00:04:41,330
the Medicine Demon has arrived.

78
00:04:53,060 --> 00:04:57,860
This person's divine bone has been extracted, making her no different from a cripple.

79
00:05:02,230 --> 00:05:02,860
However,

80
00:05:04,260 --> 00:05:06,630
there is a surge of spiritual power in her body.

81
00:05:06,630 --> 00:05:09,400
How can there be spiritual power without the divine bone?

82
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,860
That's the strange part.

83
00:05:10,860 --> 00:05:13,760
It's impossible to have spiritual power without the divine bone.

84
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:14,930
But I've only seen

85
00:05:15,730 --> 00:05:16,990
this phenomenon once.

86
00:05:17,930 --> 00:05:21,660
It was the old Heavenly Sovereign of the Heavenly Realm who possessed the ancient divine vein.

87
00:05:21,660 --> 00:05:22,500
Baili,

88
00:05:23,200 --> 00:05:25,800
you actually possess the ancient divine vein.

89
00:05:38,530 --> 00:05:39,930
God of War Baili is awake.

90
00:05:41,500 --> 00:05:42,430
You may leave us.

91
00:05:50,960 --> 00:05:52,090
Turn your head away.

92
00:05:57,760 --> 00:05:58,460
My injuries

93
00:06:00,200 --> 00:06:01,530
are completely healed.

94
00:06:03,800 --> 00:06:04,400
Wife,

95
00:06:05,200 --> 00:06:06,460
you're finally awake.

96
00:06:08,200 --> 00:06:10,660
Where am I?

97
00:06:11,460 --> 00:06:12,430
Our home.

98
00:06:12,630 --> 00:06:15,100
My injuries seem to be healed.
